Z||000016||jch82||05-03-2001||11:47 PM||||I would take a set as well....<P>Those looks kick a$$!<P>So how exactly do they mount on the door panels? And how much do they stick out? Thanks<P>Josh   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Yeah, my girlfriend takes collect calls from the road<BR>And it doesn't seem to matter that I'm lacking in the bulge<BR>She laughs at my dumb jokes when no one does<BR>She brings me mexican food from Sombrero's just because<BR>                 <I>-Blink 182</I><p>[This message has been edited by jch82 (edited 05-03-2001).]||||reg||12
